{
  "requirement": "The harness instructs the model to finish by calling\n{cite}`requirements.sdk.graph.agent-harness.submission.mcp`.",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "The subject `requirements.sdk.graph.agent-harness.submission` has one obligation. The harness must instruct the model to finish by calling `submit_result`. It cites `.submission.mcp`, which defines the tool's shape. That requirement is assessed on its own, so I did not reassess it here.\n\nThree reviewed tests assert that the instruction text \"Finish by calling submit_result\" reaches the model:\n- `crates/trust-but-verify/src/agent/tests.rs#fn[assistant_text_and_provider_failure_cannot_become_typed_results]` serializes `requests[0].chat_history` on the generic `ToolAgent` path and asserts it contains the instruction. It also checks that a text-only reply earns a reminder and then an error.\n- `crates/trust-but-verify/src/agent/configured.rs#mod[tests]/fn[supplied_openai_backend_runs_independent_calls_against_a_local_transport]` asserts the instruction is in `input` for all four requests sent to the local OpenAI-style transport.\n- `crates/trust-but-verify/src/agent/configured.rs#mod[tests]/fn[supplied_ollama_backend_delivers_tools_and_results_over_native_chat]` asserts the instruction is in `messages` on both native chat requests.\n\nThe assertions check the content actually sent to the model. A harness that left the instruction out would fail them. Together they cover the generic path and both supplied backends. The first-turn request in each test carries the instruction, so it is present from the start of the conversation.\n\nThe other tests listed (`default_tool_accepts_scalar_results_and_keeps_the_exact_prefix` and `typed_submission_references_resolve_and_invalid_results_are_agent_errors`) check the tool schema, which belongs to `.submission.mcp`. They add context and do not leave a gap here. I found no gaps or marking problems, and there are no acknowledgments to weigh.",
  "references": "6d3090f0bb60675c1ce9da3313f3f3f65297e0a05452744687240cd1bb853491",
